# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# Anything listed here is never uploaded, so it cannot be requested at any
# URL. This is the strongest control available to a static site: there is no
# gate to misconfigure because the file does not exist on the CDN.

# --- Admin area -------------------------------------------------------------
# These pages have no server-side authentication. The login form only ever
# compared a password in client-side JavaScript, which any visitor can read
# and bypass, and admin-dashboard.html had no check at all. The admin area is
# not in use, so it is kept out of production entirely.
#
# To bring it back: put a real gate in front of it first (see deploy/README.md),
# then remove these lines.
pages/admin-blog.html
pages/admin-dashboard.html
pages/admin-login.html
pages/blog-login.html

# --- Not needed by a static deployment --------------------------------------
# The local development server and its helpers.
server.js
api/
scripts/
deploy/
.github/

# Source notes and planning documents.
BACKLOG.md
